rt for BYOK and local models, improved organization runner controls, and firewall settings for Copilot cloud agent.\",\n    \"updateType\": \"release\",\n    \"url\": \"https://github.blog/changelog\",\n    \"date\": \"2026-04-02\",\n    \"community_feedback\": []\n  },\n  {\n    \"productName\": \"Codex CLI\",\n    \"title\": \"Version 0.122.0: Enhanced TUI, Plugin Workflows, and Security Improvements\",\n    \"description\": \"Codex CLI 0.122.0 released on April 20, 2026, featuring standalone installer improvements, TUI enhancements with `/side` conversations, tabbed plugin browsing, and filesystem permission controls with deny-read policies.\",\n    \"updateType\": \"release\",\n    \"url\": \"https://developers.openai.com/codex/changelog\",\n    \"date\": \"2026-04-20\",\n    \"community_feedback\": []\n  },\n  {\n    \"productName\": \"Codex CLI\",\n    \"title\": \"Version 0.121.0: Marketplace, Memory Mode, and MCP Expansions\",\n    \"description\": \"Codex CLI 0.121.0 released on April 15, 2026, adding marketplace command, TUI prompt history improvements, memory mode controls, expanded MCP/plugin support with Apps tool calls, and secure devcontainer profile.\",\n    \"updateType\": \"release\",\n    \"url\": \"https://developers.openai.com/codex/changelog\",\n    \"date\": \"2026-04-15\",\n    \"community_feedback\": []\n  },\n  {\n    \"productName\": \"Codex CLI\",\n    \"title\": \"Codex Becomes Broader Workspace Tool with In-App Browser and Computer Use\",\n    \"description\": \"Codex announced major updates on April 16, 2026, including an in-app browser for page commenting, Computer Use for macOS app automation, thread automations, task sidebar, pull request workflow integration, and artifact viewer.\",\n    \"updateType\": \"feature\",\n    \"url\": \"https://developers.openai.com/codex/changelog\",\n    \"date\": \"2026-04-16\",\n    \"community_feedback\": []\n  },\n  {\n    \"productName\": \"Codex CLI\",\n    \"title\": \"Model Availability Update